{"unit_id":"Meiyukichan__sandore#card-zh","repo":"Meiyukichan/sandore","commit":"79019429941c51c0c7b93c5e1333fdc09acd8b17","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"sandore（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：为 DSH 提供工作流编排引擎和管理界面。它组合持久化、工作流运行时与远程接口，并在 Web 客户端挂载侧栏和会话内工作流视图。可管理工作流定义和库、启动运行实例，并查看与操作工作流会话。适合需要在 DSH 中设计并运行多步骤代理流程的用户。运行依赖 DSH 宿主，bundle 配置 SQLite 存储。","source":"generated","evidence":["packages/workflow/plugin.ts:27-38","packages/client/index.ts:45-57","cordis.patch.yml:1-25"]}
{"unit_id":"Meiyukichan__sandore#card-en","repo":"Meiyukichan/sandore","commit":"79019429941c51c0c7b93c5e1333fdc09acd8b17","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"sandore is a DSH web plugin for workflow orchestration. It combines a host runtime and persistence with a sidebar and in-session workflow view. Users can manage definitions and libraries, then start workflow instances. It requires the DSH host and configures SQLite storage.","source":"generated","evidence":["packages/workflow/plugin.ts:27-38","packages/client/index.ts:45-57","cordis.patch.yml:1-25"]}
